HOUSE RESOLUTION NO. 4  Reps. Steven Smith and Simpson offer the following:  RESOLVED, that the Speaker may employ such personnel as he may deem necessary and, with the approval of the House subcommittee of the Committee on Legislative Facilities, may fix their compensation in accordance with RSA 17-E:5.